### Design Decisions Summary

| Task | Rule Type | Rationale |
|------|-----------|-----------|
| find brown_wool | position_near_with_facing | Preferred rule for find/locate tasks. max_distance=5 prevents false positive from spawn (player starts ~3 blocks away but not facing it). Facing requirement confirms visual identification. |
| find pink_concrete | position_near_with_facing | Same logic. Pink concrete center is ~7 blocks from spawn, so max_distance=5 requires deliberate navigation toward it. |
